### AI Fabric Runtime (Option D2) — local smoke requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8097
@userId = user-1
@sessionId = user-1-session
@conversationId = chat-user-1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Swagger UI (open in browser)
# {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui/index.html

### Chat: query (no OpenAI => expect an orchestration error result)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "query": "What can you do?"
}

### Chat: suggestions (no OpenAI => fallback suggestions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "content": "I want to search my docs",
  "maxSuggestions": 5
}

### Conversations (requires ai.chat.enabled=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations?ownerId={{userId}}

### Conversation detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}?ownerId={{userId}}

### Delete conversation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}?ownerId={{userId}}

### Data Sync: list vector spaces (requires embeddings enabled + data sync enabled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/data-sync/vector-spaces

### Data Sync: upsert a document into vector space "document"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/data-sync/upsert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vectorSpace": "document",
  "id": "doc-1",
  "content": "Return policy: returns accepted within 30 days with receipt.",
  "metadata": { "source": "runtime.http" },
  "trace": { "requestId": "req-1", "userId": "{{userId}}", "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}" }
}

